cy Response' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Activate Emergency Response' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Deploy Rescue Teams' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Activate Emergency Response'. If 'Activate Emergency Response' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Deploy Rescue Teams'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Activate Emergency Response\",\"description\":\"The 'Activate Emergency Response' activity initiates the formal emergency response protocols and mobilizes resources.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Rescue Teams\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Rescue Teams' activity involves sending trained personnel to affected areas to conduct search and rescue operations.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Deploy Rescue Teams' activity occurs, then a 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity must eventually occur after the 'Deploy Rescue Teams' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Deploy Rescue Teams' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Provide Medical Assistance' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Deploy Rescue Teams'. If 'Deploy Rescue Teams' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Provide Medical Assistance'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Rescue Teams\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Rescue Teams' activity involves sending trained personnel to affected areas to conduct search and rescue operations.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Provide Medical Assistance\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity delivers medical care and treatment to injured individuals in the disaster zon